No image, graphic or other asset of Clavia's is included in this repository or
in G2fresh's builds and releases. The optional Classic look is built on the
user's computer, at run time, from the user's own copy of Clavia's free
download "Nord Modular G2 OS v1.62 Update.dmg" (nordkeyboards.com), the same
file the Emulated G2 takes the G2 OS from: G2fresh reads the original editor's
graphics in it and keeps them in a cache in the user's settings folder. Those
graphics remain the property of Clavia DMI AB.

assets/clavia/panels.json holds the positions, sizes, kinds and captions of the
elements of each module panel, as read from Clavia's Nord Modular G2 Editor
v1.62 with tools/assets/build_assets.py, without any of their pixels.

