The optional G2 emulator (emu/, built with -DG2_BUILD_EMU=ON) uses the DSP56300
emulator by The Usual Suspects (https://github.com/dsp56300/dsp56300) and the
ColdFire CPU core of Gearmulator (https://github.com/dsp56300/gearmulator), both
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 and fetched at build
time. No Clavia firmware is included: the emulator runs the user's own copy of
the G2 OS.
Where the system has no zlib (Windows), the .dmg reader (clavia/, used by the
emulator and the Classic look) uses the inflate code of zlib 1.3.1 by Jean-loup
Gailly and Mark Adler (zlib licence), fetched at build time.
